Package: slxos
Type: Package
Title: Orthogonal SLX Score Tests for Spatial Durbin Models
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Marcos", "Herrera-Gomez", email = "mherreragomez@conicet.gov.ar",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Exact decomposition of the SLX (spatially lagged regressors) score
    test into a projection onto the common-factor direction, numerically equal
    to the classical robust Lagrange multiplier test for a spatial lag, and an
    orthogonal remainder that isolates covariate-specific spillovers. Provides
    the orthogonalised score OS_theta and its exact F counterpart, the classical
    Anselin (1996) diagnostic battery, a closed-form rescaled sandwich statistic
    (single SARAR fit, no resampling) robust to spatial-error contamination, and
    a guided diagnostic sequence. Implements the methods of Herrera-Gomez (2026).
